## Mitigation
- **Patch:** `sudo 1.9.17p1` or later (deprecates `-R` option entirely)
- **Workaround:** None — immediate patching required
- **Package managers:** `apt update && apt upgrade` (Debian/Ubuntu), `dnf upgrade sudo` (Fedora/RHEL), `pacman -Syu sudo` (Arch)

